2) VERTICAL P+/NW/PSUB BIPOLAR

      .lib BIP

            Model name      emitter area      base area         unit
          ------------------------------------------------------------
              pnp10             100              256            um^2
          ------------------------------------------------------------
            ( P+/NW/PUB vertical PNP bipolar )


3) N+/PW, P+/NW & NW/PSUB junction diode

      .lib DIO

        Scalable junction diode model ( level 3 ) was used for modeling.
        User can change the AREA, PJ (perimeter) according their layout
        to simulate their circuit.


4) INTERCONNECTION MODEL TABLE

       1. typ_strA : typical case, structure A interconnection table

       2. typ_strB : typical case, structure B interconnection table

       3. wor_strA : worst   case, structure A interconnection table

       4. wor_strB : worst   case, structure B interconnection table


5) RAW DATA :

      ## raw data files:

        1.  readme.txt : explain how to read the raw data format 

        2.  nmos.log   : for NMOS DEVICES GROUP (without ESD implant)

        3.  pmos.log   : for PMOS DEVICES GROUP (without ESD implant)

        4.  nmos3.log  : for 3V NMOS DEVICES GROUP (without ESD implant)

        5.  pmos3.log  : for 3V PMOS DEVICES GROUP (without ESD implant)


6) UPDATE HISTORY :


      V1.3 : Adding interconnect capaciatnce models.
             Addind NW/Psub diode model.
             Adding N+ diff. w/o silicide w/i ESD & NW diffusion (under OD)
             resistance's temperature & delta_W coefficients.
             Revised sheet resistance values for Metal 1 ~ Metal 5.

      V1.2 : Change V0.3 3.3V MOS model to V1.1 3.3V MOS model.
             Added V1.1 3.3V NMOS model with ESD implant.
             Revised resistor model in metal resistance.

      V1.1 : Create 2.5V MOS model & added V0.3 3.3V MOS model, P+/NW/Psub
             vertical bipolar model, diode model, and resistor model.
